                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="p1-v78" parent="p1-v77" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" value="• Request deadline · bounded retries with backoff + jitter (429 / 5xx)&lt;br&gt;• Simulated dependency timeout / rate limit&lt;br&gt;• Structured logs correlated by request ID&lt;br&gt;• Managed identity + RBAC · Key Vault · no secrets in code&lt;br&gt;• Azure Monitor / App Insights&lt;br&gt;• Versioned analyzers &amp;amp; indexes → safe re-index and rollback" vertex="1">
